      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "While the kitchen crew watches Barani treat their boss like an errand boy during the masterclass, Max admits to Kostya at the bar that he made a huge mistake. Realizing he still loves Vika despite how complicated things are between them, Max decides he needs to end things with Sasha before their flight.",
